WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.470
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:12.740
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.540
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:22.020
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.760
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.430
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:45.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.430
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.630
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.290
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:11.440
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:20.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.360
I am reporting to
Grand Demon Lord Xenon.

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.700
At last, the time has come for
me to challenge Devilman.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.940
Please behold my work
from the netherworld.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:54.940
With my needle and thread, I
shall ensnare the human world.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.120
Even Devilman will be
helpless under my spell!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.070
Stitch up the men!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:25.110
Sew up the town!

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.050
Pierce their heads!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:35.590
EVIL GENERAL MUXAN
THE GREAT SCHOOL ASSAULT

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.700
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.710
Excellent.
I have trapped the humans.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:02.280
I can't wait to see the look of
shock on Devilman's face!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.520
That girl is ice-cold.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.520
Miki can't even wait a minute
for me to fix my motorcycle.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.890
At least I waited for you.
That's good, right?

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:21.770
You think you can take Miki's place?
Look in a mirror sometime!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:23.940
Nyah!

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.310
Fair enough.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.540
- What?
- Huh?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:36.080
What the hell? I know I
just drove through there.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.150
Did you get enough sleep?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.130
My bad!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.380
There!

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.730
Hey, what's going on here?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.170
- There!
- Ouch!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.370
It's not a dream.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:59.640
All right.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:05.770
Huh?

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.150
That's impossible!

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.660
What's wrong?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.810
There's no one at school.
It's like an abandoned house.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.180
Look, you can see the back entrance.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.280
- It's a shadow.
- Shadow?

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:43.240
The real school isn't here.
It might be somewhere really far away.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:46.190
Perhaps in another dimension.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.720
W-What does that mean?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.300
I can't really explain it all that well.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.200
Sis!

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.280
Miyo!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.050
Tare!

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.850
Akira!

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:16.810
Tare isn't here yet?

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.850
Not yet.
I'm gonna have a quick look.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:19.850
Me too.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.090
Huh?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.860
- That's weird.
- What's weird?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.320
But...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.030
How creepy!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:33.600
Let's go out again!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.630
You're telling me to my face that
I'm creepy? How rude!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.270
Hold it, Miki!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.170
Oh my!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.510
I'm back inside the academy.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.670
It's the same for you too!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.250
I don't like this.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.630
I'm back where I started!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.620
What's this?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:05.390
TEACHER'S OFFICE

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:08.160
Who’s behind this?!
ls it you, Alphonne?!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.510
I've been here!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.140
This is just ridiculous.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.310
But it's true. We can't
leave the academy!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:22.920
Very well.
I'll show you how!

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.190
Let's see. Let's see.
Let's see. Let's see.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.950
See? There's nothing stopping y--

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.130
Did it not work?

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:37.960
See?

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.240
WHAT? !

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:54.950
What should I do?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.590
I, the principal...

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.990
I, the principal of this school,
have gone out of my mind.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:14.340
Therefore, I hereby
resign my position...

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:18.670
How am I going to go on?

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.510
We can't get through the gate,
so let's climb over it!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.020
Huh? What's this?

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.090
Todoroki, what do you see there?

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:40.820
My eyes must be acting up!
Is there a zoo past this wall?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.960
I can see a tanuki!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.100
Just hurry Up!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.500
Here it goes...

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.810
That's not a tanuki,
that's the principal!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.740
But why did I fall over
the wall and land here?

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.610
You little!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:07.580
Punish! Punish! Punish!
Punish! Punish! Punish!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.490
My beloved Miyo,
where did you go?!

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:14.630
- Stop, it's no use!
- Miyo!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.820
That does it, Muxan!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.360
You've kidnapped Miki and the
entire school as well!

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.110
Devilman, what do you think?

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.070
There you are!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.370
DEVIL!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.450
Devil Kick!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.220
Devil Beam!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.040
Devil Wing!

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.340
Let's go, Muxan!

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:01.010
Wait!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.440
You better calm yourself.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:08.550
If you kill me, those children
will never come back!

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:12.120
You're in a real
predicament now, Devilman.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.750
All your comrades are
in my possession.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.690
There is only one way to save them!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.320
Kneel before me.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:26.530
Kiss my feet. Then wait
for Lord Xenon's judgment!

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.700
Don't you like it?

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.040
Very well. I shall give
you time to think.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:35.640
I shall return in half
an hour for your answer!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.820
CHACO

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.390
Welcome!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.060
Aren't you going to school?
It's already started, hasn't it?

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.930
Well, the school...

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.460
Don't worry about it.
Hey, bring me some whiskey!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.300
Huh?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.600
...would be an irresponsible
thing to say. I'll have some coffee.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.740
Of course!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.240
Hit me with a... I mean,
lemon squash, please, sir.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.010
All right.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:13.750
Delinquents sure
start young these days.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.780
Don't tell anyone about it.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.250
Adults won't trust
us if we tell them.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.210
And if things get serious,
they'll just freak out.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.780
- So you're just gonna leave them?
- Of course not!

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.760
We've got 15 minutes left.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.350
15 minutes?

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.960
Don't worry about it.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.470
Tare!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.770
Tare, you want to save
Miki and Miyo, right?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.870
Of course!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.540
Would you be able to handle
some scary stuff to do it?

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.770
Sure! Well, I'm not
sure-sure, but I'll try!

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:45.220
Good.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.710
I want you to head
back to the school, alone.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.650
The school?
You want me to go back?

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:54.250
Yes! I need you to be there!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:59.490
Well, I don't get why, but
I'll do it if it'll save them.

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:00.730
Thanks!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.770
What did you say?
There are several landscapes?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.700
What's this all about?

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:16.100
Maybe the landscape changes
depending on who's looking.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.200
Okay, I'll go up next!

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.010
Sir, I looked...

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.380
...and I saw a big creepy face!
And it was laughing at me!

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.750
It really did, sir!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.750
Okay, I got it!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.920
Chaco, you go next!
I'll go after you.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:34.150
But...

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.860
I'll give it a go!

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.400
Miyo, will you be all right?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.870
I'll be just fine!

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:43.660
Huh?

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.340
What a beautiful starry sky!

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.270
It's beautiful!
It's like I'm dreaming!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.380
What, beautiful?
Hey, Miyo!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.010
Hurry back down!
I'll go next!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:02.580
Just a little longer.
What a beautiful shooting star!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:03.930
A shooting star?

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:14.070
Miyo, hurry up!
Let me have a look!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.170
See?

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.540
What's beautiful about it, Miyo?
It's crawling with monsters!

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.580
But look there!
A shooting star!

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.380
Are you mocking me?!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.450
But...

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.720
Enough! Go switch out with Miki!

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:44.430
Yes, sir.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.830
Mr. Alphonne!

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.040
I can't see anything!

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.380
Did you see anything over there?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.680
Was it a monster?

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:10.650
Don't be so rude!
I saw myself! It was me!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.660
Just as I thought...

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:18.660
I don't know how, but we seem to have
dropped into a pocket dimension.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.670
I see.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.860
You really are smart, Hairo!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:28.180
What's a pocket dimension?
Does it go in a dress dimension?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.520
Not like a pocket in clothes!
It's quantum physics!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.850
This is a life or death situation!

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.450
Miki! Miyo!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:42.720
Mr. Alphonne!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:46.420
Muxan believes he's
got all my friends.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:50.230
If Muxan finds Tare outside,
that'll be my chance!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:55.060
Principal! Mr. Janitor!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.740
Let me into the school!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.540
Why won't you let me in?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.750
You're one of his comrades?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.290
Join the others!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.420
Now's my chance!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.960
DEVIL!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.930
Curses! Devilman got in!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.490
Help! Help me!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.100
Mr. Alphonne!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:33.930
- Sir!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.440
Are you all right, sir?

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:44.990
A monster!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.450
Hey, don't leave me behind!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.130
Help! Help! Help!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.230
Sis!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.470
- Ta--
- Miyo!

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:05.600
I missed you, Tare!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.840
How I've longed to see you again!

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:10.880
Bonehead.

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.920
It's the end of the world!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.760
Oh no! Pervert!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.390
Chaco!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.840
Hairo!

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.770
Father, Mother, forgive me for
preceding you to the grave!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.440
It's for my beloved Chaco.
Please understand.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:43.910
Damn you!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.560
Devil Kick!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.760
Devil Chop!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:09.900
Devil Wing!

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:17.010
Devil Cutter!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.650
Devil Beam!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.260
It's Muxan!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:37.020
Impressive, using a boy as bait to
find your way to the netherworld.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.270
Allow me to congratulate you.
Here is your reward!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:49.900
Unfortunately, I was simply toying
with you before your impending death!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:25.550
If you kill me, those children
will never come back!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:30.350
But, he still won't let them
go, even if I let him live!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.780
Muxan is just another demon.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.220
His magic won't hold after he dies.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.260
All right, it's now or never!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.130
Devil Beam!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.450
Demon Lord Xenon, please forgive me.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:13.620
A moment's carelessness
brought about my end.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.190
A general should not make such a mistake.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.030
I will die to atone for my error!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.180
Muxan was swallowed
back up by the earth.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:48.830
But if he was right, we'll be
stuck in this dimension forever!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.780
Why you!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.930
So then, it was just a dream.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.000
WAS IT AN ILLUSION?!
WHAT ABOUT THE DEMON?!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:07.350
True, but I usually have nightmares
about needing to take a leak.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.280
You do, Kiyohiko?

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.550
You, too, Principal?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.550
- Then, shall we--
- Wake each other up!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.730
I'm so glad, Miyo!

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:26.200
Akira, you made it inside!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.210
Tare, you did good!
You saved us all!

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:34.440
See? I helped save you!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.800
Thank you, Tare. But how?

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.940
Well, I don't know exactly...

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:43.140
Akira, are we all safe?

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.040
Is the school back to normal?

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.360
Are you still worried?
See for yourself.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:53.930
Tare! Try throwing this ball
through the front gate, would you?

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.530
Here we go!

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.770
How's that? Huh?

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.600
Did the ball get out all right?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.710
Thank you, it came right out!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.110
Good! See? We can walk
right through the gate.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:21.150
So the nightmare's over.
Everything is back to normal!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.970
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:56.680
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:04.330
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:10.180
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:14.130
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.340
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:22.340
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:33.190
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:53.220
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:59.420
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:04.910
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:12.050
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:16.800
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:19.800
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:26.480
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:36.620
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:59.710
Akira and his friends all go skiing.

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:03.120
On the train, Tare sees a ghost.

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:07.250
No way!

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:09.390
A ghost!

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:13.390
Waiting for Akira and the others
on the snowy mountaintop

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:15.820
is a terrible string of murders.

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:20.290
Who is the killer who
lurks within the lodge?

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:38.340
Listen well, Lala.
Go to the human world.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.880
Send a message to the
hero of the Demon Tribe.

00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:43.850
Take as many human
lives as you can.

00:23:43.850 --> 00:23:48.700
Keep the traitorous Devilman
locked in place and kill him!

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:12.750
Damn!

00:24:17.520 --> 00:24:21.690
Demon assassins, one after
another, are sent after Devilman.

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:26.690
The transforming Dodo and Demon Lala,
who can use magic to take any face.

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:33.240
These demon assassins take on Akira's
appearance to instigate a mass murder.

00:24:37.300 --> 00:24:42.140
Falling into the demons' trap,
Devilman loses his superpowers.

00:24:42.140 --> 00:24:43.620
Devilman is in peril!

00:24:44.180 --> 00:24:48.420
Next time on Devilman:
DEMON OF THE SNOW, LALA
